  "term": "rapport",
  "definition": "Rapport is a multi-dimensional, harmonious connection between a clinician and a client or family that supports cooperation and engagement. In this context, it is seen as important for successful telehealth work because it helps encourage buy-in and follow-through beyond sessions.",
